Ship of Harkinian for the Apple Watch, applied by tools/build-oot.sh.

- CMakeLists.txt, soh/CMakeLists.txt: a watchOS platform. The game is built as
  a static library for the watch app, without Torch and the in-game ROM
  extractor (the archives are made on the Mac); its dependencies come from
  port/oot/cmake/watchos.cmake. Text-to-speech uses AVSpeechSynthesizer, as on
  the Mac.
- soh/soh/OTRGlobals.cpp: no ROM extraction step on the watch (the archives
  are in the app bundle); error boxes go to the log; when frames fall
  behind the game's rate, the audio thread makes up the missing audio.
- soh/src/code/main.c, graph.c: on the watch, main() is SohWatch_Start(), which
  sets the game up and returns, and Graph_RunFrame() runs one frame, so the
  watch app drives the frame loop.
- soh/assets/tools/torch-cli/main.cpp: read the ROM before handing it to
  SohTorch::Extract(), which takes its bytes (an upstream build break).

